        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abisirayeli bazacungurwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko noneho Uwiteka wakuremye wowe Yakobo, kandi akakubumba wowe Isirayeli, aravuga ati “Witinya kuko nagucunguye, naguhamagaye mu izina ryawe uri uwanjye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunyura mu mazi nzaba ndi kumwe nawe, nuca no mu migezi ntizagutembana. Nunyura mu muriro ntuzashya, kandi ibirimi byawo ntibizagufata ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kuko ndi Uwiteka Imana yawe, Uwera wa Isirayeli Umukiza wawe. Nagutangiriye Egiputa ho incungu, Etiyopiya n'i Seba nahatanze ku bwawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuko wambereye inkoramutima kandi ukaba uwo kubahwa nanjye nkagukunda, ni cyo kizatuma ntanga ingabo zigapfa ku bwawe, n'amahanga nkayatangirira ubugingo bwawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ntutinye ndi kumwe nawe, nzazana urubyaro rwawe ndukure iburasirazuba, nzagukoranya ngukure iburengerazuba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nzabwira ikasikazi nti ‘Barekure’, n'ikusi mpabwire nti ‘Wibīmana.’ Nzanira abahungu banjye bave kure, n'abakobwa banjye bave ku mpera y'isi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nzanira umuntu wese witiriwe izina ryanjye, uwo naremeye kumpesha icyubahiro. Ni jye wamuremye, ni jye wamubumbye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sohora impumyi zifite amaso n'ibipfamatwi bifite amatwi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "amahanga yose akoranywe, amoko yose aterane. Hari abo muri bo babasha kutubwira bakatwereka ibyabayeho? Nibatange abagabo batsindishirizwe. Cyangwa se bumve bemere ko ari iby'ukuri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwebwe n'umugaragu wanjye natoranije muri abagabo bo guhamya ibyanjye”, ni ko Uwiteka avuga, “Kugira ngo mumenye, munyizere, munyitegereze ko ari jye. Nta mana yambanjirije kubaho, kandi nta yizamperuka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Jyewe, jye ubwanjye ni jyewe Uwiteka, kandi nta wundi mukiza utari jyewe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni jye wabwirije ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " kandi ndakiza, ndabigaragaza kandi muri mwe nta yindi mana yahabaye, ni cyo gituma muri abagabo bo kumpamya ko ari jyewe Mana.” Ni ko Uwiteka avuga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kandi koko uhereye aho umucyo wabereyeho ndi we, nta wubasha gutesha ukuboko kwanjye. Ubwo nzakora umurimo ni nde uzankoma mu nkokora?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwiteka umucunguzi wanyu, Uwera wa Isirayeli aravuga ati “Ku bwanyu natumye i Babuloni nzamanura abaho bose ari impunzi, ari bo Bakaludaya bazahunganwa n'inkuge zabo biratanaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni jyewe Uwiteka Uwera wanyu, Umuremyi wa Isirayeli n'Umwami wanyu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umva ibyo Uwiteka avuga, ari we waremye inzira mu nyanja agacisha inzira mu mazi menshi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "agasohora amagare n'amafarashi: ingabo n'intwari baguye hamwe ntibazabyuka, bazimye nk'uko bazimya imuri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ibya kera ntimubyibuke, kandi ibyashize mwe kubyitaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dore ngiye gukora ikintu gishya, ubu ko kigiye kwaduka ntimuzakimenya? Nzaharura inzira mu butayu, ntembeshe imigezi mu kidaturwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inyamaswa zo mu gasozi, ingunzu n'imbuni bizanyubaha, kuko ntanga amazi mu butayu, ngatembesha imigezi mu kidaturwa, kugira ngo nuhire ubwoko bwanjye natoranije, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abantu niremeye ubwanjye ngo berekane ishimwe ryanjye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ariko Yakobo we, ntabwo wantakiye. Isirayeli we, waranzinutswe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ntabwo wanzaniye amatungo yawe magufi ngo untambire ibitambo byoswa, kandi ntumpesheje icyubahiro ibitambo byawe. Sinagukoresheje umurimo w'amaturo, kandi sinakuvunishije kunyosereza imibavu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ntiwatanze ifeza ngo ungurire ibihumura neza, kandi ntiwampagije ibinure by'ibitambo byawe, ahubwo wankoreye ibyaha byawe, wamvunishije ibicumuro byawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ubwanjye ni jye uhanagura ibicumuro byawe nkakubabarira ku bwanjye, kandi ibyaha byawe sinzabyibuka ukundi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nyibutsa tuburane, shinga urubanza rwawe kugira ngo utsindishirizwe. ",
